=== F. The label map ('scaled down to N'): N = (A+1)/2, F(N) = (Syr(2N-1)+1)/2
PASS F(N) = (3N-1+2^w)/2^(w+1), w = v2(3N-1): even N -> 3N/2, N = 1 mod 4 -> (3N+1)/4, N = 3 mod 4 -> F((N+1)/4); N - F(N) = ((2^(w+1)-3)N - (2^w-1))/2^(w+1)  (N <= 10^6)
PASS preimages: label n = 2 (mod 3) has none; otherwise exactly N_j = 4^j N_0 - (4^j-1)/3 (j >= 0) with N_0 = 2n/3 (n = 0 mod 3, an even label) or (4n-1)/3 (n = 1 mod 3, a label = 1 mod 4)  (n <= 3000, N <= 10^6)
PASS difference multiset of the label map: N - F(N) = e occurs m(e) times (e >= 0; m(0) = 1), = -e exactly once
PASS 'exactly two copies of each |difference|' first fails at e = 2: |N - F(N)| = 2 for N = 3, 4, 9 (three copies)
    fraction of 1 <= e <= 10^4 with exactly two copies of |difference|: 0.6959 (density delta_1 = 0.696175)
PASS in the owner's K (odd labels only): 0 and 1 occur once, 2 is the first value occurring twice, 24 the first occurring three times
